stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unsynchronized : Ingestion
    Unsynchronized --> Pending : Enqueue validation
    Pending --> Synchronizing : Invariants checks pass
    Synchronizing --> Current : State merge successful
    
    Current --> Stale : Validity age exceeded
    Stale --> Expired : Expiration timeout triggered
    
    Expired --> [*]
